            "description": {
              "value": "You make an assessment informed by your knowledge of how a creature fights. Attempt a check to Recall Knowledge about a creature. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your check if you previously hit the creature with a Strike this turn. If your check is successful, recharge your SoM. The subject of your check is temporarily immune to Magus's Analysis for 1 day."
